# Moddy Arena: the break between two waves. Before the battle he makes a house in the arena (a wish that changes the
# arena) and a Fire Sword he puts on his hotbar. He sets WAVES to 10 and starts a battle. When a wave is cleared there
# is a break: the boss bar counts it down (15 seconds after a wave, 45 after the boss wave), the board's start button
# reads READY and its state line is the break's timer, and the arena mends itself: the house is gone, a hole in the
# floor is filled, an arrow left lying is tidied, and a creature in it stays. Pressing READY ends the break in 3
# seconds. In the longer break after the boss wave he changes his hotbar from My wishes (the house goes on it), presses
# READY, and the house's hotbar wish fires in the next wave.
# Each wave takes him into the arena and shuts the gate behind him; in each break the gate is open and he is back at the
# board (by command, to keep it short) to press READY. A resistance effect keeps him on his feet; the monsters are not
# what this tests, so each wave is ended by command (SHORTCUT), and the arena is torn up by command as a wish could.
# play-timeout: 1500
@intent between two waves there is a break with a visible timer, longer after a boss wave, that READY on the board ends early; the arena mends itself in it, and he may change his hotbar in it and fire the new wish in the next wave
@world flat seed=1
@continue-on-fail

@step arrive
@expect chat Welcome to Moddy Arena within 90s
@wait 2s
difficulty hard
difficulty normal
gamemode survival
effect give @s minecraft:resistance 1500 4 true
effect give @s minecraft:saturation 1500 0 true

@step before the battle a house lands in the arena ahead of him
# he makes it from inside the arena, as in 2-wish-in-the-arena: a house made from the middle of the prep room can stand
# partly in the prep room, and its garden fence then takes his clicks on the watch and the control panel. He is in
# survival, so he steps up to the gate first to reach it.
teleport @s 0.5 64 19.5 180 0
@wait 10t
@aim pos 0.5 64.5 16.5
@key key.use
@wait 10t
@assert execute if block 0 64 16 minecraft:oak_fence_gate[open=true]
@aim look 180 0
@key key.forward hold 45t
@wait 10t
@assert execute if entity @s[z=-15,dz=29]
@aim look 180 12
@wait 2s
moddy apprentice a cozy house
@expect screen Container within 10s
@click slot 0
@expect chat /is ready/ within 90s
@wait 3s
@assert execute unless blocks -15 64 -15 15 67 15 -15 200 -15 all
@shot a-house-in-the-arena
# back in the prep room, the gate shut behind him
teleport @s 0.5 64 19.5 180 0
@wait 10t
@aim pos 0.5 64.5 16.5
@key key.use
@wait 10t
@assert execute if block 0 64 16 minecraft:oak_fence_gate[open=false]
# back where he arrived: within reach of the gate, the gate takes the watch's click (a block is used before the item)
teleport @s 0.5 64 21.5 180 12
@wait 10t

@step a Fire Sword, on his hotbar from its page
moddy apprentice a fire sword
@expect screen Container within 10s
@click slot 0
@expect chat /Fire Sword( [0-9]+)? is in slot 3/ within 60s
@wait 2s
@key key.hotbar.1
@key key.use
@expect screen /make a wish/ within 10s
@click button "My wishes"
@expect screen My wishes within 10s
@click item "Fire Sword"
@expect screen Fire Sword within 10s
@click item "Add to hotbar"
@expect chat On your hotbar, slot 4 within 10s
@wait 1s
@key key.keyboard.escape
@wait 10t
@key key.keyboard.escape
@wait 10t
@expect screen none within 3s

@step WAVES 10, and he starts the battle
teleport @s 0.5 64 21.5 180 0
@key key.hotbar.9
@wait 10t
@key key.forward hold 15t
@wait 1s
@aim pos -0.5 65.5 17.1
@key key.use
@expect actionbar Waves: 10 within 3s
@wait 25t
@aim pos 3.5 65.5 17.1
@key key.use
@expect chat A battle is starting within 5s
@expect title Wave 1 of 10 within 15s
@wait 1s
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_start_label,nbt={text:{text:"START BATTLE"}}]

@step wave 1 is cleared: a break with its timer, READY on the board, and the arena mended
# SHORTCUT: as a wish could, a hole is torn in the floor and an arrow lies in the arena; a cat stands in for his own
# creature
fill -1 63 6 1 63 8 minecraft:air
summon minecraft:arrow 6 64 6
summon minecraft:cat 6 64 10 {PersistenceRequired:1b}
@wait 1s
@assert execute unless block 0 63 7 minecraft:smooth_sandstone
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect chat Wave 1 cleared! Break time: the gate is open, and the next wave comes in 15 seconds. within 10s
@expect chat The arena is mended for the next wave. within 5s
@expect bossbar /Wave 2 of 10 in 1[0-5] seconds/ within 3s
@wait 1s
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_start_label,nbt={text:{text:"READY"}}]
@assert execute if block 0 63 7 minecraft:smooth_sandstone
@assert execute if blocks -15 64 -15 15 67 15 -15 200 -15 all
@assert execute unless entity @e[type=minecraft:arrow,x=-16,y=60,z=-16,dx=32,dy=20,dz=33]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:cat,x=-16,y=60,z=-16,dx=32,dy=20,dz=33]
# in the break the gate is the fence gate again
@assert execute if block 0 64 16 minecraft:oak_fence_gate
@assert execute if block 0 65 16 minecraft:air
@aim look 180 15
@wait 1s
@shot the-break-and-the-arena-mended
# back to the board (the wave took him into the arena)
teleport @s 0.5 64 19.5 180 0
@wait 10t
@aim pos 3.5 65.5 17.1
@wait 5t
@shot ready-on-the-board

@step READY ends the break in 3 seconds
@key key.use
@expect chat Everyone is ready! The next wave comes in 3 seconds. within 3s
@expect bossbar /Wave 2 of 10 in [1-3] seconds?/ within 2s
@expect title Wave 2 of 10 within 5s
@wait 1s
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_start_label,nbt={text:{text:"START BATTLE"}}]
# the wave took him in again, and the gate is shut
@assert execute if entity @s[x=-1,y=63,z=14,dx=3,dy=3,dz=2]
@assert execute if block 0 64 16 minecraft:iron_bars

@step waves 2 to 4, each followed by its break
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect chat Wave 2 cleared! within 10s
teleport @s 0.5 64 19.5 180 0
@wait 10t
@aim pos 3.5 65.5 17.1
@wait 5t
@key key.use
@expect title Wave 3 of 10 within 8s
@wait 1s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect chat Wave 3 cleared! within 10s
teleport @s 0.5 64 19.5 180 0
@wait 10t
@aim pos 3.5 65.5 17.1
@wait 5t
@key key.use
@expect title Wave 4 of 10 within 8s
@wait 1s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect chat Wave 4 cleared! within 10s
teleport @s 0.5 64 19.5 180 0
@wait 10t
@aim pos 3.5 65.5 17.1
@wait 5t
@key key.use
@expect title BOSS WAVE within 8s
@wait 2s

@step after the boss wave, the longer break
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect chat Wave 5 cleared! Break time: the gate is open, and the next wave comes in 45 seconds. within 10s
@expect bossbar /Wave 6 of 10 in 4[0-5] seconds/ within 3s
@wait 1s
@shot the-longer-break

@step in the break he changes his hotbar: the house goes on it from My wishes
# he turns from the board first, or his click presses READY instead of his watch
@aim look 0 30
@wait 5t
@key key.hotbar.1
@key key.use
@expect screen /make a wish/ within 10s
@click button "My wishes"
@expect screen My wishes within 10s
@click item "Cozy House"
@expect screen Cozy House within 10s
@click item "Add to hotbar"
@expect chat On your hotbar, slot 5 within 10s
@wait 1s
@assert execute if items entity @s hotbar.4 minecraft:paper
@key key.keyboard.escape
@wait 10t
@key key.keyboard.escape
@wait 10t
@expect screen none within 3s
@shot a-new-loadout

@step READY, and the new hotbar wish fires in the next wave
teleport @s 0.5 64 19.5 180 0
@wait 10t
@aim pos 3.5 65.5 17.1
@wait 5t
@key key.use
@expect chat Everyone is ready! within 3s
@expect title Wave 6 of 10 within 6s
@wait 1s
# the wave took him into the arena: the house lands ahead of him there
@aim look 180 12
@key key.hotbar.5
@wait 5t
@assert execute if items entity @s weapon.mainhand minecraft:paper
@key key.use
@expect chat /is ready/ within 90s
@wait 3s
@assert execute unless blocks -15 64 -15 15 67 15 -15 200 -15 all
@shot the-house-from-the-hotbar
